from m6-event-regi-ice.replay
# Event branch m6-event-regigigas (docs/research/postgame.md §4): Snowpoint Temple
# B5F's Regigigas with the three titans in the party (check_has_all_legendary_titans_in_party). Staged: the Regis
# caught in m6-event-regi-iron/-rock/-ice went to the PC (the party was full); slots 1–3 take their place here (L30,
# as caught), a Master Ball, and the player at the statue (sys-snowpoint-temple walks the temple). A on it:
# FLAG_AWAKENED_REGIGIGAS, the statue shakes, the L1 battle, caught: FLAG_CAUGHT_REGIGIGAS, hidden.
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_REGIROCK 30
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_REGICE 30
party 3 platinum:SPECIES_REGISTEEL 30
give item platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SNOWPOINT_TEMPLE_B5F 11 13 up
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_AWAKENED_REGIGIGAS false
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle catch platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 20000
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_REGIGIGAS caught
advance text 20000
until idle 3000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_AWAKENED_REGIGIGAS true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_REGIGIGAS true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_SNOWPOINT_TEMPLE_B5F_REGIGIGAS true
